died interactions, allowing for the independent identification and pursuit of tasks.", "evidence": ["source-2561135a17314579", "source-95fe466131c64554", "source-ddf6ac46620a4e24"], "id": "blog-autonomous-problem-inquiry-1", "lede": "Can autonomous agents independently generate and pursue research goals, and what architectures support this capability?", "notebooks": ["notebook-proj-unassigned-inquiry-1"], "project": "proj-unassigned-inquiry", "reason": "Synthesize the findings on autonomous goal generation and architecture required for independent inquiry.", "title": "Autonomous Problem Formulation via Hybrid Architectures", "type": "blog"}], "reason": "Worker draft retained for all-member group synthesis; individual publication is disabled", "status": "withheld"}, "hash_fields": ["version", "beliefs", "commitments", "journal", "projects", "notebooks", "research", "posts"], "id": "w-a37e9841ef1b437f", "metadata": {"model_version": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_attempts": [{"elapsed_ms": 7887, "finish_reason": "STOP", "http_status": 200, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "model_version": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider": "google-gemini", "provider_input_chars": 40752, "provider_input_hash": "06d69c7ecb493d75b456fdb99c9eab132c7d906639333762fad4c25e1fd0ed23", "request_payload_bytes": 43655, "result": "success", "usage": {"candidatesTokenCount": 926, "promptTokenCount": 11689, "promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT", "tokenCount": 11689}], "serviceTier": "standard", "thoughtsTokenCount": 109, "totalTokenCount": 12724}, "web_evidence": {"search_queries": [], "sources": [], "url_retrievals": []}}], "provider_requests_sent": 1, "successful_model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "usage": {"candidatesTokenCount": 926, "promptTokenCount": 11689, "promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT", "tokenCount": 11689}], "serviceTier": "standard", "thoughtsTokenCount": 109, "totalTokenCount": 12724}}, "proposal": {"actions": [], "base_version": 17, "summary": "No research action